{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend, hit the field, and brace yourself for Gameday Mayhem!! \u2013 the local multiplayer brawl that asks: &quot;What if football had no strategy, no rules, and possibly\u2026 a rifle?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a 3-minute duel where two players run, dodge, tackle, and fumble their way to victory. Want to pass the ball? Sure, but don\u2019t expect your AI teammates to help\u2014they\u2019re barely functional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think Nidhogg meets American football. So, lace up, lock in, and prepare for zero strategy, all chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/extras/Quote_Kasim_S.png?t=1743754048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(and Gameday Mayhem may actually be the worst game!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GameDay Mayhem!!\u00a0 is <strong>2-Player-only and local-only</strong>. It supports gamepads but it can also be played with two players on one keyboard. Try the demo to find out if your keyboard supports shared keyboard. To play online with a friend you can use Remote Play Together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364980?t=1743754048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743754048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/11f9e60193b053697bc1cbd14b77d5516c8cef00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743754048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/11f9e60193b053697bc1cbd14b77d5516c8cef00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743754048","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend, hit the field, and brace yourself for Gameday Mayhem!! \u2013 the local multiplayer brawl that asks: &quot;What if football had no strategy, no rules, and possibly\u2026 a rifle?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a 3-minute duel where two players run, dodge, tackle, and fumble their way to victory. Want to pass the ball? Sure, but don\u2019t expect your AI teammates to help\u2014they\u2019re barely functional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think Nidhogg meets American football. So, lace up, lock in, and prepare for zero strategy, all chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/extras/Quote_Kasim_S.png?t=1743754048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(and Gameday Mayhem may actually be the worst game!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GameDay Mayhem!!\u00a0 is <strong>2-Player-only and local-only</strong>. It supports gamepads but it can also be played with two players on one keyboard. Try the demo to find out if your keyboard supports shared keyboard. To play online with a friend you can use Remote Play Together.</p>","developers":["Indifferent Penguin"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364980/header.jpg?t=1743754048","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257084173,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084173/movie480.mp4?t=1734860412","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084173/movie_max.mp4?t=1734860412"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail